    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) \u0db8\u0dd3\u0dc5\u0d9f\u0da7, \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc1\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf. \u0d94\u0db6\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dcf\u0da9\u0dd2 12\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db4\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db6\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf.\n\n1157 1158\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dc1\u0db1\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc1\u0dc3\u0dd2 \u0da0\u0db1\u0dca\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n2023 \u0dc1\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca 28\n\n[3.24 p.m.]\n\nHon. Prime Minister, the first is a matter that has generally been spoken of both by the Tamil and Muslim Members of Parliament. In fact, I asked the Hon. Yadamini Gunawardena whether I could meet you, Hon. Prime Minister, some time to discuss this matter. This is with regard to the Kalmunai North Divisional Secretariat in the Ampara District. Hon. Prime Minister, in 1989, Kalmunai North was recognized as a new AGA Division. Then, thereafter, in the seventh month of 1993, Cabinet approval was obtained for it to be made a Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division. Since then, it has been functioning as such, except for the accountant and the land office being transferred to that Division. So, the Kalmunai Divisional Secretariat, at the moment, holds those, but for all other purposes - if you look at the cadre also - Kalmunai North is recognized and is functioning as a fully-fledged Divisional Secretariat. Now, the problem, Hon. Prime Minister, is that there is a lot of political pressure that is being brought, which I am aware of, to downgrade that into a sub-office which, in fact, is not. One of the key tactics that is being used is the prevention of the appointment of an accountant and not transferring the land office from the current Kalmunai Divisional Secretariat to the Kalmunai North Divisional Secretariat. Therefore, Hon. Prime Minister, I humbly request you to intervene in this matter."
  },
