    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "f2550af3d8dd3d118d5ad209e76df276",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1942,
    "chunk_text": "What did he say? He said the Seventeenth Amendment to the Constitution had established the Constitutional Council as part of the Executive. That is wrong. He said that at that time, he, the Hon. K.N. Choksy and Hon. Karu Jayasuriya drafted that law. That is also wrong. It was at the insistence of the Janatha Vimukthi Peramuna at that time, in 2001, that it was brought in. He was talking about something else; he was talking about the aborted Eighteenth and the Nineteenth Amendments, which were never passed in this House and which he, during his tenure as Prime Minister, brought to clip the wings of the Executive President at that time. He was reading from the Determinations on those, claiming that they were part of the Determination on the Seventeenth Amendment. He even said that \"the Hon. Sumanthiran appeared in the case for the Centre for Policy Alternatives\". I was bemused because in 2001, I was not in the country; I was reading for my Master\u2019s Degree elsewhere.\n\n\u201cIn that respect the provisions relating to the establishment and functions of the Constitutional Council is the core of the Seventeenth Amendment. These provisions are contained as noted above in the new Chapter VIIA ...\u201d\n\nAnd, that is where the Leader of the House was also wrong. On that very day, he rose in this House and said that the Constitutional Council appears under the same Chapter, \"The Executive.\" That is wrong. There is a new\n\n1927 1928\n\n\u0db4\u0daf\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\n\nChapter created. \u201cThe Executive\u201d is Chapter VII and a new Chapter VIIA was created. Sui generis organization, the Constitutional Council is neither a part of the Executive nor a part of the Legislature. On that day, I made an intervention. I did not say it was part of the Legislature; I said it was part of the legislative structure and that is what the Determination on the Seventeenth Amendment also says, I later found out. It further states, I quote:"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2020s",
    "doc_id": "2023-12-02-2023-12-02",
    "num": "2023-12-02",
    "date_str": "2023-12-02",
    "description": "Hansard of December 02, 2023",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.parliament.lk/en/business-of-parliament/hansards",
    "lang": "si-ta-en",
    "url_pdf": "https://www.parliament.lk/uploads/documents/hansard/1706259286008569.pdf",
