    "chunk_text": "Now, with regard to the Executive\u2019s power, which has been curtailed by the Constitutional Council, that must have some meaning. The Seventeenth Amendment was brought for good governance, the Determination recognizes that. It was sought to be taken away by the Eighteenth Amendment, brought back by the Nineteenth Amendment, taken away again by the Twentieth Amendment and brought back by the Twenty-first Amendment with a lot of fanfare, saying \"we are bringing this back\". But, you cannot say \"we have brought back the checks and balances on the President\" while the President behaves as though there are no checks and balances, that he is a be-all and end-all of all and that his nomination must be accepted. To say \u201cI will make only one nomination and it must be accepted\u201d is wrong. That is not the intention of Parliament when it enacted these Amendments three times over to curtail the untrammelled power of the Executive President and that must be noted because, now, we have come into a situation of another crisis of governance. This has an implication on economic recovery as well. This has also been highlighted even by the IMF. The President\n\n[\u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0daf \u0d85\u0dad \u0db4\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0d89\u0dc0\u0db8\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd3.] [\u0b85\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0b95\u0bcd \u0b95\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0b95\u0bb3\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bbf \u0b85\u0b95\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1] [Expunged on the order of the Chair.]\n\n[\u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0daf \u0d85\u0dad \u0db4\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0d89\u0dc0\u0db8\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd3.] [\u0b85\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0b95\u0bcd \u0b95\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0b95\u0bb3\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bbf \u0b85\u0b95\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1] [Expunged on the order of the Chair.]"
  },
