    "chunk_text": "as has been talked about here, has made all kinds of statements and claims, which have really damaged those institutions. For instance, take his attitude towards the Local Authorities Election, which the independent Election Commission declared. The Hon. President came to Parliament and said that he did not know what election was being talked about because no election had been declared. When the Judiciary, in a Determination, ordered that that election must take place and that the money approved by Parliament for that must be allocated, that did not happen. The Executive\n\nignores the Determination of the Supreme Court. The Hon. President\n\n[\u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0daf \u0d85\u0dad \u0db4\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0d89\u0dc0\u0db8\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd3.] [\u0b85\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0b95\u0bcd \u0b95\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0b95\u0bb3\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bbf \u0b85\u0b95\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1] [Expunged on the order of the Chair.]\n\n1939 1940\n\n\u0db4\u0daf\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\n\nclaims in various speeches that the people of this country do not want elections, that that is not the priority of the people, indirectly attempting to influence the Judiciary. Then, he comes to Parliament and claims that the Constitutional Council is an extension of the Executive power. He continues to make these kinds of wild and very irresponsible claims constantly, undermining the independence of the Judiciary and the role of the Judiciary in protecting the people of this country and standing by their interests."
