    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) Hon. Member, you have two more minutes. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dad\u0dd2 \u0d86\u0da5 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0dc6\u0db1 \u0dc4\u0d9a\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0bc8\u0bbf \u0bb1\u0bb5\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd \u0bb9\u0b95\u0bc0\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. Rauff Hakeem, Attorney-at-Law) Sir, I will take about two, three minutes from the Hon. Kiriella's time. He told me to.\n\nNow, Sir, what the country thinks regarding those attacks is quite apparent from this poll. Therefore, it is important for us to allay these fears and suspicions that have arisen. Particularly, the Catholic community led by the Cardinal, the Catholic Bishops' Conference and various others has spoken ad nauseam about this. But, now, what is important is this. There had been some new evidence that had emerged. Some may dismiss what had been revealed by \"Channel 4\". My Friend, Mr. Pillayan, is seated behind. He had also alleged to have been involved in it; that is what one of his own colleagues had said. My Friend is supposed to have gone and made a statement. But, there must be some detailed investigation done into what had already been revealed.\n\nThen, there have been other issues regarding intelligence operatives, who have been prevented from giving evidence or whose statements have been prevented from being collected. All of that will shed some new light, if at all. You can forget about the cases that have already been filed. But, I genuinely feel that if the Attorney-General\u2019s Department had been a little more probing even with regard to those cases that had been filed - against the entire lot, they had gone and filed charges - certain people among them could have been made crown witnesses to further shed light on this matter because they have much more valuable evidence. I am not going to name people. I have been very carefully examining court records and the evidence that had already"
  },
