    "chunk_text": "Then, there have been other issues regarding intelligence operatives, who have been prevented from giving evidence or whose statements have been prevented from being collected. All of that will shed some new light, if at all. You can forget about the cases that have already been filed. But, I genuinely feel that if the Attorney-General\u2019s Department had been a little more probing even with regard to those cases that had been filed - against the entire lot, they had gone and filed charges - certain people among them could have been made crown witnesses to further shed light on this matter because they have much more valuable evidence. I am not going to name people. I have been very carefully examining court records and the evidence that had already\n\nWhy did they go and arrest Mr. Shani Abeysekara, who was a CID Officer and was investigating into this? Then, why did they arrest Mr. Hejaaz Hizbullah? They said that Hejaaz Hizbullah is the \u0dcf\u0dc4 \u0dc1\u0dcf\u0daf \u0daf \u0d9a\u0daf. Now, he is in the process of getting acquitted. \u0dc1 \u0daf\u0da0\u0dca\u0dca \u0dca\u0daf\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dd2 \u0dc1\u0d9c\u0daf\u0dad\u0dbd\u0daf \u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dc1\u0db6\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0daf\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0db1 \u0d91 \u0d85\u0dd2\u0dba\u0d9a\u0daf\u0dca\u0db1\u0daf\u0db0\u0dd2 \u0dab\u0dc1\u0dda \u0dd3\u0dbb\u0dca \u0daf\u0dd4\u0dc1\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dca \u0dcf\u0dd0\u0dca \u0dc1\u0dc4\u0dc5\u0dd2\u0dcf \u0dda \u0dc1\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0dbd\u0daf \u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dc1\u0db6\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0daf. \u0dca\u0daf\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dd2 \u0dc1\u0d9c\u0daf\u0dad\u0dbd\u0daf, \u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0daf\u0dc1\u0dda \u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0dd0\u0dbb\u0dd0\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0db1 \u0d91 \u0db4\u0dd2\u0dc5\u0dd2\u0db6\u0db3\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d \u0dc1\u0db4\u0daf\u0da9\u0dca\u0da9\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da7 \u0dca\u0dbd \u0daf \u0db6\u0dbd\u0dbd\u0daf \u0da7\u0dba\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dba\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dba\u0dd2. I think you will have to allay the suspicions among the people. Today, more than half of the country is believing that there was a political conspiracy, that it has not come out of nowhere. Therefore, with those matters also in mind, please see that a fresh investigation is conducted into this matter because it has gone to Geneva. So, it is going to be much more contested in Geneva in the coming few months.\n\nHaving said that, Sir, I conclude my speech. Thank you."
  },
