    "chunk_size_bytes": 1767,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dc0\u0dd3.\u0dc0\u0dd3. \u0daf\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9c\u0bc0.\u0b9c\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) Hon. Presiding Member, I would like to start my comments referring to one matter since the Hon. State Minister of Justice and Prison Affairs is here. As you know, as Tamil Members of Parliament, we visit the prisons quite a bit and meet with the Tamil political prisoners. In the course of those meetings, we also talk to the prison officials and of late, those officials, who total to about 6,000, have been pleading with us to urge the Government to consider them, with regard to salaries and allowances, on par with the those in the Sri Lanka Police. I think those in the Sri Lanka Police, because of this economic crisis, are getting almost 40 per cent of their salary as incentives or allowances, which is not being made available to the prison authorities. So, I urge you to consider their request because the job they do is as important as what is done by the police and since it is also not a large number, but only 6,000. So, again, I ask you to consider their request.\n\nThen, with regard to the convicted prisoners, I appeal to you to understand that they had been convicted under the PTA. We all reject the PTA. Your Government and even the Hon. Minister have raised about the PTA. -\n\n2011 2012\n\n\u0db4\u0daf\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\n\n[Interruption] Thank you, Hon. Minister. The Hon. Minister made commitments on that in 2015 when he went to Geneva with the late Hon. Mangala Samaraweera. It was during your tenure as Minister of Justice at that time that the Government of Sri Lanka made commitments that they would create a moratorium on the application of the PTA."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2020s",
    "doc_id": "2023-12-02-2023-12-02",
    "num": "2023-12-02",
