    "chunk_text": "If I may say so, there are a few solutions we can adopt and in the interest of time, let me just quickly give my thoughts on it. If I can start off by saying what is important at this particular point of time, it is education and sexual education. In relation to sexual education, we must focus on comprehensive sexuality education and that is something we have been arguing about for many years but, unfortunately, we have actually not seen the light of it. It is only through CSE in schools that children and young people will develop accurate and age-appropriate knowledge, attitudes and skills, positive values such as respect for human rights, gender equality and diversity and attitudes and skills that contribute to a safe, healthy and positive relationship. CSE plays a pivotal role in the preparation of young people for a safe, productive and fulfilling life in a world where HIV, AIDS, sexually transmitted infections, unintended pregnancies and sexual and gender-based violence still pose a risk to their well-being. CSE basically empowers children to take control and make informed decisions about their sexuality and relationships, freely and responsibly.\n\nI would also like to say that assault of not just women, but also children is a sensitive issue, which no one speaks\n\n2185 2186\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dae \u0dc1\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0daf]\n\n2023 \u0dc1:\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dd0\u0dda\u0db3\u0dbb\u0dca 04\n\nabout. Unfortunately, we have to speak about it because we need to bring about a change, if we are going to protect the next generation. Every two hours, a child is sexually molested in this country! People may not admit it, they may not want to hear it or may not want to say it, but that is a fact and that must be accepted. One thousand seven hundred and twenty one is the number of children below the age of 16 who were raped, and that was reported in 2021. There are unreported cases, too, my fellow Members."
  },
