    "chunk_size_bytes": 1742,
    "chunk_text": "Apart from that, there are certain legislative amendments which are required to address this. One is, the introduction of new child courts. The Government is already working on a new law to reform the Domestic Violence Act. There would be reforms to the marriage and divorce laws to ensure there is an easier path to divorce. No one should be forced to remain in a marriage that is either abusive or not healthy. Apart from that, rape needs to be criminalized across the board.\n\nIn the interest of time, Sir, I am tabling* my prepared speech.\n\nI know that the Hon. Presiding Member, who is from the estate sector, will criticize me for not speaking about the estate sector.\n\nThank you. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) Next, the Hon. Premnath C. Dollawatte. You have seven minutes.\n\n[3.18 p.m.]\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5 \u0daf\u0dda\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dd3\u0dad. \u0daf\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dc0 \u0d9a\u0dad\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dca\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba3\u0bbf \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bb0\u0bae\u0bcd\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0bbf. \u0ba4\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb2\u0bb5\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. Premnath C. Dolawatte, Attorney-at-Law) Hon. Presiding Member, I really acknowledge the reforms proposed by the Hon. Jeevan Thondaman. We are also willing to take part in bringing the reforms that have been discussed.\n\nWe are afraid to talk about sexuality, Sir. We must ensure that sexual education is included in the Grade 7 Health and Physical Education Textbook and thereby, we can educate all the children in Sri Lanka about sexuality. I believe most of these child abuses occur due to lack of sexual knowledge."
